    "aboutTheProgramContent1": "Coke Fresh is ",
    "aboutTheProgramContent2": "a 6-month functional trainee program",
    "aboutTheProgramContent3": " designed to be a career launchpad for young talents to fizz up their passion and gain valuable applied experience in Coca-Cola corporate world. Our program also offer fertile soil for developing, sharpening their competitive skills (hard and soft skills) and making groundbreaking strides on their career!​\n\n\n\nAre you a driven, innovative Gen Z eager to ",
